class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16940.208922\">4:42:20</span>  **324.** naindriyapaccayā sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### najhānadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16972.332443\">4:42:52</span>  **325.** najhānapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17016.39037\">4:43:36</span>  najhānapaccayā nahetupaccayā naārammaṇapaccayā sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### namaggadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17052.970459\">4:44:12</span>  **326.** namaggapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17101.188951\">4:45:01</span> namaggapaccayā nahetupaccayā naārammaṇapaccayā sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### nasampayuttadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17146.340797\">4:45:46</span>   **327.** nasampayuttapaccayā hetuyā pañca, adhipatiyā pañca, sahajāte pañca, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye pañca, kamme pañca, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre pañca, indri